    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7589" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά-σχεσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέχομαι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>holding up, lifting up,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβοσκίδος,</span> of an elephant, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.972b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>holding in suspense,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δεινῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Num.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡλίου</span>
			<i>rising</i> of the sun, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				393b2
			</span></i>(pl.).</div>
